# Changelog

## 0.1.0 (2026-05-29)

### Initial launch

- OTLP protobuf trace receiver for ingesting spans from etrace SDKs
- Trace list with status, duration, token count, and cost summaries
- ChatFlow overview: user prompts, LLM responses, and tool call pills
- Span tree with inline timeline bars and expand/collapse
- Flame timeline visualization
- Resizable span detail panel with Input, Output, and Attributes sections
- JSON tree viewer with expand/collapse and overflow-safe wrapping
- Dark mode support
- Seed traces for local development
- Responsive layout with collapsible sidebar
